type: software
title: "econ-finance-lit-review: Systematic, link-verified literature reviews for economics and finance"
abstract: "An Agent Skill for Claude that turns a research question into a documented systematic review: question-first intake, a fixed publication window, multi-database search, registry-based verification of every reference, three-pass study cards with weakness analysis, certainty-graded answers, a PRISMA 2020 audit trail and an optional illustrated report."
